{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"503833","name":"强风猛进之述演","desc":"5.2版本活动 强风猛进之述演","icon_url":"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/12/18/4521515/6b112fff99a29597a2b4915bd757bcaf_4281492040893027655.jpg","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"强风猛进之述演","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://upload-bbs.miyoushe.com/upload/2024/12/13/75276539/0e0349810434e6c8a4b8e03b84bed5ee_8947493161545462394.jpg?x-oss-process=image//resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,jpg\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.miyoushe.com/upload/2024/12/13/75276539/0e0349810434e6c8a4b8e03b84bed5ee_8947493161545462394.jpg?x-oss-process=image//resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,jpg\\\" style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":true,\"is_show_switch\":true,\"without_border\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1311","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"说明","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\\\"\u003e〓活动时间〓\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(173, 114, 14)\\\"\u003e2024/12/18 10:00 ~ 2024/12/30 03:59\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\\\"\u003e〓活动奖励〓\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://upload-bbs.miyoushe.com/upload/2024/12/13/75276539/02c06c4e5d716d551ada0111eea60b94_3729885001472364965.png?x-oss-process=image//resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.miyoushe.com/upload/2024/12/13/75276539/02c06c4e5d716d551ada0111eea60b94_3729885001472364965.png?x-oss-process=image//resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\\\"\u003e〓参与条件〓\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(173, 114, 14)\\\"\u003e冒险等阶≥20级\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(173, 114, 14)\\\"\u003e完成魔神任务：序章·第三幕「巨龙与自由之歌」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\\\"\u003e〓活动说明〓\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(17, 17, 17)\\\"\u003e● 在\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(26, 26, 26)\\\"\u003e「强风猛进之述演」活动中，旅行者每个回合都会获得一定数量的交战单位和战斗策略。选取合适的交战单位和战斗策略，分析对手和自己的阵容，安排合理的出战单位，方可克敌制胜。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(17, 17, 17)\\\"\u003e● 进行推演即可获得\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e推演勋章\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(17, 17, 17)\\\"\u003e。活动开启后，第一天的\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e「推演勋章」上限为2000点，活动开始后第3\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(17, 17, 17)\\\"\u003e天和第5天会各解锁1000点\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e「推演勋章」上限，最高上限为4000点。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":true,\"is_show_switch\":true,\"without_border\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1312","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"玩法","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://upload-bbs.miyoushe.com/upload/2024/12/16/75276539/ab855d55a24bffb4ccd55d53b670efb5_7189838645524215892.png?x-oss-process=image//resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.miyoushe.com/upload/2024/12/16/75276539/ab855d55a24bffb4ccd55d53b670efb5_7189838645524215892.png?x-oss-process=image//resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e旅行者好呀！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e听说西风骑士团最近在尝试运用\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(26, 26, 26)\\\"\u003e「兵棋推演」分析战法，探寻进步之道，一起来看看吧！\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://upload-bbs.miyoushe.com/upload/2024/12/16/75276539/565a19ecd3d5587269778cf58b12752d_4939381417213907087.png?x-oss-process=image//resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg cl