cess=image//resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://upload-bbs.miyoushe.com/upload/2024/12/16/75276539/a3918bbd1a0a4a02eda6b7bab45d9e09_8902332876021439976.png?x-oss-process=image//resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.miyoushe.com/upload/2024/12/16/75276539/a3918bbd1a0a4a02eda6b7bab45d9e09_8902332876021439976.png?x-oss-process=image//resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://upload-bbs.miyoushe.com/upload/2024/12/16/75276539/6e4121142e9826879df5b166b742353f_1089905835702222437.gif\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.miyoushe.com/upload/2024/12/16/75276539/6e4121142e9826879df5b166b742353f_1089905835702222437.gif\\\" style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":true,\"is_show_switch\":true,\"without_border\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1313","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"流程","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e抽选交战单位和战斗策略\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/12/20/4521515/efa19be9b9f8185347f09121212609c1_8508180641639756084.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"360\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 360px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/12/20/4521515/efa19be9b9f8185347f09121212609c1_8508180641639756084.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 360px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e「强风猛进之述演」中,旅行者需要收集交战单位和战斗策略,组成出战阵容，与对手的阵容进行战斗。每场推演中，需要进行10回合的战斗,每回合都需要迎战不同的对手。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/12/20/4521515/9b4cd4e6ad423c04629cab4e10030c24_2089279047876744568.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"360\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 360px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/12/20/4521515/9b4cd4e6ad423c04629cab4e10030c24_2089279047876744568.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 360px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e每回合的战斗开始前，旅行者将获得一定次数的机会，用以抽选交战\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e单位和战斗策略。每回合都会有一定次数的「刷新选项」机会，能在选取交战单位或战斗策略时替换当前的所有选项。抽选的交战单位和战斗策略将保留到本场推演结束。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/12/20/4521515/12be391a04978fe7515743e5a03a153f_4165509913221920959.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"360\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 360px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/12/20/4521515/12be391a04978fe7515743e5a03a153f_4165509913221920959.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 360px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e在每场推演的第1/3/5/7回合,旅行者将获得1次机会，抽选战斗策略战斗策略能为推演提供多种助益,合理选择战斗策略，可对推演产生可观的影响。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/12/20/4521515/c3e6c7aa8bc5d2824c7e93b9ca5bb831_430508627450713472.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"360\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 360px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/12/20/4521515/c3e6c7aa8bc5d2824c7e93b9ca5bb831_430508627450713472.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 360px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e交战单位有着普通、精锐和顶尖三种精锐度，对应的初始等级分别为20/25/30。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e随着推演进行，出现更高精锐度交战单位的概率也将提升。精锐交战单位将在第2回合后出现，顶尖交战单位将在第5回合后出现。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/12/20/4521515/dadfc7c269192b5675d4d707ca8efc02_4023055175420674084.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"360\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 360px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/12/20/4521515/dadfc7c269192b5675d4d707ca8efc02_4023055175420674084.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 360px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e拥有2个等阶相同的交战单位时，会立刻将它们合成为1个等阶高一阶的战斗单位。最多可以通过这种方式合成3阶的战斗单位。战斗单位的等阶越高，等级便越高，战斗力也越强。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e准备阶段\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/12/20/4521515/ea77e3b8a96383d083b6179b6f0e5e45_3545684810267241110.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"360\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 360px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/12/20/4521515/ea77e3b8a96383d083b6179b6f0e5e45_3545684810267241110.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 360px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e战斗开始前，可以确认对方出战的阵容,从而调整我方阵容，合理分配出战顺序。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/12/20/4521515/a283d45b75f23328f04744375c4d5c98_6994819123302951369.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"360\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 360px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/12/20/4521515/a283d45b75f23328f04744375c4d5c98_6994819123302951369.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 360px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e可以通过执行退换单位操作，退回暂时派不上用场的单位，换取机会抽选新的单位。每退换一个1/2/3阶交战单位,分别可以获得1/2/4点增援点数，消耗3点增援点数，可以获得1次抽选新单位的机会。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e战斗阶段\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/12/20/4521515/f4e6e0eef535c24f94ccc15ceb893f4c_8913798564381363767.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"360\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 360px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/12/20/4521515/f4e6e0eef535c24f94ccc15ceb893f4c_8913798564381363767.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 360px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e战斗开始后，双方的交战单位将依照出战顺序自动入场，向对方行进。并发起攻击。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/12/20/4521515/ab0c5068446c011072917b0393cbaeca_7122774180096872179.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"360\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 360px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/12/20/4521515/ab0c5068446c011072917b0393cbaeca_7122774180096872179.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 360px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e战斗开始时，双方只能同时派出1个交战单位。随着战斗烈度提升，双方能同时派出的单位上限也将增加。同时在场的交战单位数量低于当前上限时，阵容中未登场的单位将按照顺序入场，继续战斗。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/12/20/4521515/3447d15d723eb42a55e927dc85bf0b59_6767886930212698240.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"360\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 360px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/12/20/4521515/3447d15d723eb42a55e927dc85bf0b59_6767886930212698240.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 360px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e如果战斗进行了一段时间而未分出胜负，则将进入消耗战阶段:场上所有交战单位持续损失生命值。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/12/20/4521515/aa0bcddad40c65a2f1074c01184e322e_5900785799166536845.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"360\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 360px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/12/20/4521515/aa0bcddad40c65a2f1074c01184e322e_5900785799166536845.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 360px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e战斗中，成功击败对方所有单位的一方获胜。推演会在完成10个回合的战斗或输掉4个回合的战斗时结束。尽可能赢取更多胜局，以获得更多推演勋童吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e压制策略\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/12/20/4521515/28a2f3a90cb53dfc9acda835f38b9c33_9129581556730090184.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"360\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 360px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/12/20/4521515/28a2f3a90cb53dfc9acda835f38b9c33_9129581556730090184.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 360px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e不同的交战单位之间存在一定的压制关系：能造成范围伤害的单位，面对小队单位时具有显著优势。近战单位压制远程单位，远程单位压制空中单位，空中单位压制近战单位。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/12/20/4521515/0e3f6606e345e23a37b2211fd2eaa466_788380182920870210.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"360\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 360px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/12/20/4521515/0e3f6606e345e23a37b2211fd2eaa466_788380182920870210.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 360px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e近战单位拥有极高的战斗韧性，承受更高的伤害，能够一定程度上保护其他单位。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e空中单位能在空中飞行，从而规避来自地面的近战伤害和一些范围伤害。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e远程单位射程较远、伤害较高，但是相对比较脆弱。大部分远程单位都可以攻击空中单位。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"switch\":true,\"is_show_switch\":true,\"without_border\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1314","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":true,\"is_show_switch\":true,\"without_border\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1315","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":true,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"攻略推荐","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"strategy","layout":"","data":"{\"moduleName\":\"攻略推荐\",\"layout_\":\"banner\",\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"【观测枢】「强风猛进之述演」不知道怎么拿高分？全流程攻略\",\"cover\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/12/20/4521515/82cb4ab6e384e6b3269ed472fcdcb366_6226988885598802381.png\",\"link\":\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/article/60291870\",\"tab_id\":\"1702470367171_0\"}],\"more_link\":\"\"}","style":""}],"id":"1316","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false}],"filter_values":{},"menu_id":"0","menu_name":"","version":"1734660178","langs":[],"template_layout":{"tab":[{"tab_id":"84","tab_name":"页签1","module_group":[{"module_group_id":"748","layout":"l1r1","module":[{"id":"1311","pos":"banner"}],"name":"","repeated":false,"parent_group_id":"0"},{"module_gro